010\", \"description\": \"《说文》小篆“逭”字，从辵官声\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0139/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g011\", \"description\": \"《说文》或体“逭”字，从藺兆声\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0139/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g012\", \"description\": \"《说文》小篆“遯”字，从辵豚声\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0139/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g013\", \"description\": \"汉印文字“遯”字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0139/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g014\", \"description\": \"汉印文字“遯”字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0139/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g015\", \"description\": \"西周金文“逋”字，从辵甫声\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0139/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g016\", \"description\": \"秦代简帛“逋”字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0139/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g017\", \"description\": \"秦代文字“逋”字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0139/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g018\", \"description\": \"《说文》小篆“逋”字，从辵甫声\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-ety