otal_pdf_pages\": 1435}, \"source_file\": \"字源 - 李学勤 - 天津古籍出版社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\", \"source_pdf\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/字源 - 李学勤 - 天津古籍出版社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\", \"pdf_page_1based\": 404, \"printed_page\": null, \"metadata_provenance\": null, \"source_sha256\": \"18a343b6769e9233e124128bdbbef83c11d4f254e4a41a46d92386148944af65\", \"evidence_sha256\": \"bfdcc23c5de6f1c65d9178945ed3bce4c3646ff940d7faedf35bbe835585d778\", \"ocr_review_status\": \"unreviewed\", \"review_dimensions\": {\"transcription\": \"unreviewed\", \"layout\": \"not_requested\", \"glyph_identification\": \"page_references_with_unidentified_printed_characters\"}, \"text\": \"竹部\\n\\n字所从之“竹”或讹为从“艹”作。古代官曹整齐简策谓之“等”。《说文》:“等，齐简也。”段玉裁注:“齐简者，叠简册齐之，如今人整齐书籍也。引申为凡齐之称。”睡虎地秦简《秦律十八种·仓律》55:“城旦之垣及它事而劳与垣等者，旦半夕参。”《史记·陈涉世家》:“等死，死国可乎？”“等”皆用为等同义。又引申为等级、级别之义。《大戴礼记·少间》:“同名同食日同等。”又用为台阶义。《论语·乡党》:“出降一等。”用为类型、样子。《易·系辞下》:“爻有等。”王弼注:“等，类也。”用为动词，有衡量义。《孟子·公孙丑上》:“等百世之王。”事物品类众多，难以遍举，概谓之“等”，故“等”字可用在代词或名词之后，表示复数或列举未尽。《史记·陈涉世家》:“公等遇雨。”另“等”表等待之义，乃假借为“待”。《字汇·竹部》:“等，候待也。”今有复音词“等待”。(严玉)\\n\\n笵(范) fàn 并纽、侵部；奉纽、范韵、防鋄切。\\n\\n[glyph:g001]¹ 战国—[glyph:g002]² 《说文》小篆—[glyph:g003]⁴ 汉—[glyph:g004]⁷ 汉—范 楷书\\n                [glyph:g005]⁵ 汉—[glyph:g006]⁸ 汉—范 楷书\\n[glyph:g007]³ 《说文》小篆—[glyph:g008]⁶ 汉—[glyph:g009]⁹ 汉—範 楷书\\n\\n1《古陶字汇》168页。2、3《说文》96、302页。4《甲金篆》287页。5、6、8、9《隶辨》475页。7《汉印徵》卷5，2页。\\n\\n形声字。写在竹简上的法律条文谓之“笵”。后世一般写作“範”，从車，笵省声。汉隶“笵”字所从之“竹”或讹作“艹”，而与从艸、氾声之“范”(本草名和姓氏字)字同形。今简化字并作“范”。《说文》:“笵，法也。从竹，竹，简书也；氾声。古法有竹刑。”段玉裁注:“竹刑者，刑罚科条载于竹简也。”《孟子·滕文公下》:“吾为之范我驰驱。”赵岐注:“范，法也。”“范”的常用义是模子，引申为典范、规范、模范等义。(严玉)\\n\\n箋(笺) jiān 精纽、元部；精纽、先韵、则前切。\\n\\n[glyph:g010]¹ 《说文》小篆—[glyph:g011]² 汉—箋 楷书—笺 楷书\\n            [glyph:g012]³ 汉—[glyph:p001] 楷书\\n\\n1《说文》96页。2《汉印徵》卷5，2页。3\\n\\n《甲金篆》287页。\\n\\n形声字。从竹，戔声。字亦作“賤”，从片，戔声。今简化字作“笺”。“箋”本义是古书注释的一种。《说文》:“箋，表识书也。”《广雅·释诂四》:“箋，书也。”作为古书注释的一种，“箋”最早见于汉郑玄注毛诗，称为郑笺。唐孔颖达《毛诗正义》:“郑于诸经皆谓之‘注’，此言笺者……记识其事，故特称为‘笺’。”“箋”也是古代的一种公文体裁。《后汉书·胡广传》:“文吏试笺奏。”“笺”又指精美的小幅纸张，用以题咏或写书信。唐李商隐《送崔珏往四川》:“浣花笺纸桃花色。”亦用以称书信。宋曾巩《回泉州陈都官启》:“特枉长笺。”(严玉)\\n\\n符 fú 并纽、侯部；奉纽、虞韵、防无切。\\n\\n[glyph:g013]¹ 战国—[glyph:g014]² 《说文》小篆—[glyph:g015]³ 秦—[glyph:g016]⁴ 汉—[glyph:g017]⁶ 汉—符 楷书\\n                                [glyph:g018]⁵ 汉—[glyph:g019]⁷ 汉—苻 楷书\\n\\n1、5、6、7《甲金篆》287~288页。2《说文》96页。3《睡甲》67页。4《马王堆》183页。\\n\\n形声字。从竹，付声。汉隶“符”字所从之“竹”或讹为“艹”，而与草名或姓字之“苻”字同形。“符”为古代朝廷封爵、置官、命使或调兵遣将用的凭证。《说文》:“符，信也。汉制以竹，长六寸，分而相合。”《玉篇·竹部》:“符，符节也。分为两边，各持其一，合之为信。”新邺虎符之“符”即兵符。《周礼·地官·掌节》:“门关用符节。”郑玄注:“符节者，如今宫中诸官诏符也。”引申之，不但官家所给，凡取信之作凭证者皆谓之“符”。《史记·吕不韦列传》:“乃与夫人刻玉符，约以为适(嫡)嗣。”此“玉符”便是私下相约的凭证。两符相合斯为信，引申之，凡事物相合者，称为符合、符验、相符等。《汉书·扬雄传下》“同符三皇”之“符”乃符合之义。古人迷信，认为上天示人以征兆，吉凶与人事符合，故“符”有征兆之意，谓之“符兆”或“符瑞”等。《汉书·刘辅传》:“天之所与必先赐以符瑞。”假称神意以预示未来的神秘文书称为符谶。符是一种有明显标识的物品，故凡有标志性的事物称之为“符号”。(严玉)\\n\\n筮 shì 禅纽、月部；禅纽、祭韵、时制切。\", \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0404/source.png\", \"reading_json\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0404/ocr.json\", \"manifest\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0404/ocr.json\", \"original_evidence_sha256\": null, \"correction_provenance\": null, \"glyph_assets\": [{\"id\": \"g001\", \"description\": \"战国陶文“笵”字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0404/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g002\", \"description\": \"《说文》小篆“笵”字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0404/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g003\", \"description\": \"汉代简帛“笵”字，从竹从氾\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0404/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g004\", \"description\": \"汉印文字“笵”字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0404/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g005\", \"description\": \"汉隶“范”字，从艹从氾\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0404/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g006\", \"description\": \"汉隶“范”字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0404/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g007\", \"description\": \"《说文》小篆“範”字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0404/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g008\", \"description\": \"汉隶“範”字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0404/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g009\", \"description\": \"汉隶“範”字，从車笵省声\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0404/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g010\", \"description\": \"《说文》小篆“箋”字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0404/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g011\", \"description\": \"汉印文字“箋”字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0404/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g012\", \"description\": \"汉代文字，从片戔声（賤）\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0404/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g013\", \"description\": \"战国文字“符”字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0404/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g014\", \"description\": \"《说文》小篆“符”字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0404/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g015\", \"description\": \"秦简文字“符”字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0404/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g016\", \"description\": \"马王堆汉帛书“符”字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0404/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g017\", \"description\": \"汉代文字“符”字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0404/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g018\", \"description\": \"汉隶“苻”字，从艹付声\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0404/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g019\", \"description\": \"汉隶“苻”字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0404/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"p001\", \"description\": \"楷书“賤”的异体或本字，从片从戔（左片右戔）\", \"kind\": \"unidentified_printed_character\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0404/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}], \"block_anchors\": [], \"entry_metadata\": \"not_extracted\", \"uncertainties\": [\"Under 箋 entry, the printed character derived from 从片从戔 (左片右戔) is transcribed as [glyph:p001] as it is an unencoded/rare variant.\"], \"review_queue\": [], \"review\": null, \"spatial_repair_warnings\": [], \"use\": \"provisional_research_lead_inspect_original_page\"}\n412:{\"schema_version\": 2, \"page_id\": \"sha256:610f098b7383499e15005c51bf5908d327b3188e274cc7a1784089e9af80a721:000412\", \"book_id\": \"sha256:610f098b7383499e15005c51bf5908d327b3188e274cc7a1784089e9af80a721\", \"book\": {\"book_id\": \"sha256:610f098b7383499e15005c51bf5908d327b3188e274cc7a1784089e9af80a721\", \"pdf_sha256\": \"610f098b7383499e15005c51bf5908d327b3188e274cc7a1784089e9af80a721\", \"source_pdf_paths\": [\"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/字源 - 李学勤 - 天津古籍出版社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\"], \"current_source_filename\": \"字源 - 李学勤 - 天津古籍出版社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\", \"title\": null, \"author\": null, \"editor\": null, \"edition\": null, \"year\": null, \"publisher\": null, \"volume\": null, \"isbn\": null, \"metadata_provenance\": {}, \"total_pdf_pages\": 1435}, \"source_file\": \"字源 - 李学勤 - 天津古籍出版社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\", \"source_pdf\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/字源 - 李学勤 - 天津古籍出版社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\", \"pdf_page_1based\": 412, \"printed_page\": null, \"metadata_provenance\": null, \"source_sha256\": \"aebc5c394153f1ac1a3679e45e9c2358be6af7e2c03c6a5b75e5250a7fbfcbe0\", \"evidence_sha256\": \"0bd6abbc32fe5de93b87f7e571f8edf2b2d622123de868a5a549c5d2ba7d7c43\", \"ocr_review_status\": \"unreviewed\", \"review_dimensions\": {\"transcription\": \"unreviewed\", \"layout\": \"not_requested\", \"glyph_identification\": \"page_references_only_no_crops\"}, \"text\": \"竹部\\n\\n1《说文》97页。2、3《甲金篆》291页。\\n形声字。从竹,立声。汉隶“笠”字所从之“竹”或讹为“艹”,进而讹为从艸,而与药草名之“苙”同形。“笠”本义为笠帽,用竹箬或棕皮等编制而成,俗称“斗笠”。《说文》:“笠,簦无柄也。从竹,立声。”《诗·小雅·无羊》:“何蓑何笠,或负其糇。”毛传:“蓑所以备雨,笠所以御暑。”泛称笠状的覆盖物。《左传·宣公十四年》:“以贯笠毂。”又称门闩。《管子·四时》:“令禁扇去笠。”(严玉)\\n\\n箱 xiāng 心纽、阳部;心纽、阳韵、息良切。\\n[glyph:g001]¹—[glyph:g002]²—箱\\n《说文》小篆 汉 楷书\\n1《说文》97页。2《汉印徵》卷5,2页。\\n形声字。“箱”本义为车箱,箱内可乘人或有装物之处。《说文》:“箱,大车牝服也。从竹,相声。”段玉裁注:“郑司农云:‘牝服谓车箱,服读为负。’”《诗·小雅·大东》:“不以服箱。”毛传:“箱,大车之箱也。”引申之,凡有底、盖可以藏物的方形器俱称为“箱”。《晋书·郗超传》:“出一箱书付门生。”通“厢”,居室前厅两侧的房屋。《汉书·晁错传》:“错趋避东箱。”(严玉)\\n\\n篚 fěi 帮纽、微部;非纽、尾韵、府尾切。\\n[glyph:g003]¹—[glyph:g004]²—篚\\n战国 《说文》小篆 楷书\\n1《金文编》302页。2《说文》97页。\\n形声字。依《说文》,“篚”亦是车箱,但文献中“篚”多指圆形的盛物竹器。《说文》:“篚,车笭也。从竹,匪声。”段玉裁注:“依许,‘匡匪’之‘匪’不从竹,在匚部。从竹者,专谓车笭。”字又作“𨏴”,从車,非声。《广雅·释器》:“𨏴,箱也。”王念孙疏证:“车笭谓之篚,车箱谓之𨏴,其义一也。”“篚”又有竹器义。《书·禹贡》:“厥贡漆丝,厥篚织文。”孔传:“织文,锦绮之属,盛之筐篚而贡焉。”(严玉)\\n\\n苓 líng 来纽、真部;来纽、青韵、郎丁切。\\n[glyph:g005]¹ 2—[glyph:g006]²—苓\\n西周 《说文》小篆 楷书\\n1《金文编》302页。2《说文》97页。\\n形声字。“笭”为车轼前面纵横交结的竹木条。《说文》:“笭,车笭也。从竹,令声。”桂馥义证:“‘车笭也’者,颜注《急就篇》:‘笭,车前曲阑也。’《释名》:‘笭,横在车前,织竹为之,孔笭笭也。’”字也作“軨”,从車,令声。清王筠《说文句读》:“笭,与车部‘軨’同。”又,古代船舱中放器物的床形衬板也称“笭”。《释名·释船》:“舟中床以荐物者曰笭。”又“笭䈐”,指装鱼的竹笼,亦作“笭箸”。《说文》:“笭,一日笭䈐也。”段玉裁注:“竹笼。”宋苏舜钦《松江长桥未明观鱼》:“拟来随尔带等箸。”(严玉)\\n\\n策 cè 清纽、锡部;初纽、麦韵、楚革切。\\n[glyph:g007]¹—[glyph:g008]³—[glyph:g009]⁴——策 楷书\\n战国 《说文》小篆 汉\\n[glyph:g010]⁵—[glyph:g011]⁹—莱 楷书\\n汉 汉\\n[glyph:g012]⁶———筴 楷书\\n汉\\n[glyph:g013]¹⁰—荚 楷书\\n汉\\n[glyph:g014]²————[glyph:g015]⁷\\n战国 汉\\n[glyph:g016]⁸—[glyph:g017]¹¹\\n汉 汉\\n1《包山》68页。2《金文编》303页。3《说文》98页。4-11《甲金篆》291~292页。\\n形声字。从竹,朿声。汉隶“策”字所从之“竹”或讹为“艹”,进而讹为从艸,而与《说文》训为草刺之“茦”同形。汉隶“策”字所从之“束”或讹为“夹”,而与本训夹箸之“笑”字同形(文献中“笑”或用同“策”)。此讹变之“笑”字所从之“竹”汉隶或又讹为“艹”,而与豆荚之“荚”字同形。战国金文“策”又作“箫”,从竹,䜣(为“析”之异体,“片”为“木”之半,字从片与从木同意。秦汉文字正从析声,而作“箫”可证)声。汉隶或省去“簖”之声符“䜣”所从之“斤”,而作“笄”;或进而讹作“苄”。以上诸讹变字,皆为“策”之异体。“策”本义为竹制的马鞭。《说文》:“策,马箠也。”《礼记·曲礼上》:“君车将驾,则仆执策立于马前。”用其本义。用为动词有鞭打、驱使义。《楚辞·九辩》:“却骐骥\\n400\", \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0412/source.png\", \"reading_json\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0412/ocr.json\", \"manifest\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0412/ocr.json\", \"original_evidence_sha256\": null, \"correction_provenance\": null, \"glyph_assets\": [{\"id\": \"g001\", \"description\": \"小篆“箱”字，上竹下相\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0412/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g002\", \"description\": \"汉代隶书“箱”字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0412/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g003\", \"description\": \"战国文字“篚”字，从竹从匪\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0412/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g004\", \"description\": \"小篆“篚”字，从竹匪声\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0412/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g005\", \"description\": \"西周金文“笭”字，上竹下令\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0412/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g006\", \"description\": \"小篆“笭”字，从竹令声\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0412/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g007\", \"description\": \"战国文字“策”字，从竹朿声\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0412/source.png\", \"source