r/ziyuan-full/page-0503/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g032\", \"description\": \"汉代橘字隶书形体1\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0503/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g033\", \"description\": \"《说文》小篆橘字2\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0503/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g034\", \"description\": \"楷书橘字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0503/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g035\", \"description\": \"戠簋矛偏旁金文形体\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0503/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g036\", \"description\": \"古玺“茅”字所从矛字古文形体\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0503/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g037\", \"description\": \"橘字形1所从右上偏旁\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0503/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g038\", \"description\": \"“柔”字所从篆隶形体\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0503/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g039\", \"description\": \"橘字形2所从右上偏旁小篆形体\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0503/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g040\", \"description\": \"“柔”字所从汉隶形体\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0503/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}], \"block_anchors\": [], \"entry_metadata\": \"not_extracted\", \"uncertainties\": [], \"review_queue\": [], \"review\": null, \"spatial_repair_warnings\": [], \"use\": \"provisional_research_lead_inspect_original_page\"}\n544:{\"schema_version\": 2, \"page_id\": \"sha256:610f098b7383499e15005c51bf5908d327b3188e274cc7a1784089e9af80a721:000544\", \"book_id\": \"sha256:610f098b7383499e15005c51bf5908d327b3188e274cc7a1784089e9af80a721\", \"book\": {\"book_id\": \"sha256:610f098b7383499e15005c51bf5908d327b3188e274cc7a1784089e9af80a721\", \"pdf_sha256\": \"610f098b7383499e15005c51bf5908d327b3188e274cc7a1784089e9af80a721\", \"source_pdf_paths\": [\"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/字源 - 李学勤 - 天津古籍出版社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\"], \"current_source_filename\": \"字源 - 李学勤 - 天津古籍出版社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\", \"title\": null, \"author\": null, \"editor\": null, \"edition\": null, \"year\": null, \"publisher\": null, \"volume\": null, \"isbn\": null, \"metadata_provenance\": {}, \"total_pdf_pages\": 1435}, \"source_file\": \"字源 - 李学勤 - 天津古籍出版社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\", \"source_pdf\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/字源 - 李学勤 - 天津古籍出版社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\", \"pdf_page_1based\": 544, \"printed_page\": null, \"metadata_provenance\": null, \"source_sha256\": \"7e3e66b26dc20025b329eb1a650057978ec97518e37dfcddca427f26061d1c00\", \"evidence_sha256\": \"7deae6e4e4f89b7e1c35e1db4fa0d87d3fc93a7f71f74936ef77c3593ec0df54\", \"ocr_review_status\": \"unreviewed\", \"review_dimensions\": {\"transcription\": \"unreviewed\", \"layout\": \"not_requested\", \"glyph_identification\": \"page_references_only_no_crops\"}, \"text\": \"櫓樂梏枹椌祝槧札檢\\n\\n形声字。从木，包声。鼓槌。《说文》：“枹，击鼓杖也。”《左传·成公二年》：“（张侯）左并辔，右援枹而鼓。”陆德明释文：“枹，音浮，鼓槌也。本亦作桴。”《国语·齐语》：“执枹鼓立于军门，使百姓皆加勇焉。”古书中亦多借“桴”字为之（参见本部“桴”字）。（冀小军）\\n\\n椌 qiāng 溪纽、东部；溪纽、江韵、苦江切。\\n\\n[glyph:g001]¹——椌\\n《说文》小篆 楷书\\n\\n1《说文》124页。\\n\\n形声字。从木，空声。古代一种木制打击乐器，即“祝”。《说文》：“椌、祝，乐也。”王筠句读：“（祝）句绝，谓其一器两名也。”《礼记·乐记》：“然后圣人作为桃、鼓、椌、楬、埙、篪，此六者，德音之音也。”陆德明释文：“椌，祝也。”（冀小军）\\n\\n祝 zhù 章纽、觉部；章纽、屋韵、之六切。\\n\\n[glyph:g002]¹——祝\\n《说文》小篆 楷书\\n\\n1《说文》124页。\\n\\n形声字。从木，祝省声。古代一种木制打击乐器，奏乐开始时先击祝。《尔雅·释乐》：“所以鼓祝谓之止。”郭璞注：“祝如漆桶，方二尺四寸，深一尺八寸，中有椎柄，连底椆之，令左右击。止者，其椎名。”《汉书·律历志上》：“八音：土曰埙，匏曰笙，皮曰鼓，竹曰管，丝曰弦，石曰磬，金曰钟，木曰祝。”颜师古注：“祝与俶同。俶，始也。乐将作，先鼓之，故谓之祝。”宋孟元老《东京梦华录·驾诣郊坛行礼》：“乐作，先击祝，……每奏乐，击之内外共九下。”（冀小军）\\n\\n槧(椠) qiàn 清纽、谈部；清纽、艳韵、七艳切。\\n\\n[glyph:g003]¹—[glyph:g004]²—槧—椠\\n《说文》小篆 汉 楷书 楷书\\n\\n1《说文》124页。2《篆隶表》1079页。\\n\\n形声字。从木，斩声。本义指未经书写的书版。《说文》：“槧，牍朴也。”徐锴系传：“牍朴谓始削粗朴也。”段玉裁注：“朴，素也，犹坯（坯）也；牍，书版也。槧谓书版之素未书者也。”汉扬雄《答刘歆书》：“雄常把三寸弱翰，赍油素四尺，以问其异语，归即以铅（铅）摘次之于槧，二十七岁于今矣。”汉王充《论衡·量知》：“断木为椠，析（析）之为板，力加刮削，乃成奏牍。”引申指书的版本。宋黄伯思《东观余论·跋洛阳所得杜少陵诗后》：“政和二年夏，……于法堂壁间弊箧中得此帙，所录杜子美诗，颇与今行槧本小异。”清莫友芝《唐写本说文解字木部笺异·引言》：“近人获蜀石经残拓，宝过宋槧元钞。”新中国成立后，“車”简化为“车”（据草书楷化），“槧”类推简化为“椠”。（冀小军）\\n\\n札 zhá 精纽、月部；庄纽、黠韵、侧八切。\\n\\n[glyph:g005]¹—[glyph:g006]²—[glyph:g007]³—[glyph:g008]⁴—[glyph:g009]⁵—札\\n《说文》小篆 秦 汉 汉 汉 楷书\\n\\n1《说文》124页。2-5《篆隶表》390页。\\n\\n形声字。从木，乙(yà)声。本义指古代书写用的小木片。《说文》：“札，牒也。”徐锴系传：“牒亦木牍也。”段玉裁注：“长大者曰椠，薄小者曰札、曰牒。”《汉书·司马相如传上》：“上令尚书给笔札。”颜师古注：“札，木简之薄小者也。时未多用纸，故给札以书。”引申指书信。《广韵·黠韵》：“札，简札。”《古诗十九首》之十七：“客从远方来，遗我一书札。”又指铠甲的叶片。《广雅·释诂四》：“札，甲也。”《左传·成公十六年》：“潘尪之党与养由基蹲甲而射之，彻七札焉。”杜预注：“党，潘尪之子。蹲，聚也。一发达七札，言其能陷坚。”汉扬雄《太玄·玄柷》：“比札为甲。”北周庾信《三月三日华林园马射赋》：“七札俱穿。”（冀小军）\\n\\n檢(检) jiǎn 见纽、谈部；见纽、琰韵、居奄切。\\n\\n[glyph:g010]¹—[glyph:g011]²—[glyph:g012]³—[glyph:g013]⁴—檢—检\\n《说文》小篆 秦 汉 汉 楷书 楷书\\n\\n1《说文》124页。2、3、4《篆隶表》390页。\\n\\n形声字。从木，僉(qiān)声。本义指古代封书题签。《说文》：“檢，书署也。”段玉裁注：“书署，谓表署书函也。”王筠句读：“以木为函，复题署函上以禁闭之也。”《急就篇》卷三：“简札检署椠牍家。”颜师古注：“检之言禁也，削木施于物上，所以禁闭之，使不得辄开露也。署谓题书其检上也。”《后汉书·公孙瓒传》：“（袁绍）矫刻金玉，以为印玺，每有所下，辄龟簰施检，文称诏书。”引申指法度。《荀子·儒效》：“礼者，人主之所以为群臣寸尺寻丈检式也。”《文选·曹丕〈典论·论文〉》：“譬诸音乐，曲度虽均，节奏同检。”李善注：“《苍颉篇》曰：‘檢，法\\n\\n531\", \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0544/source.png\", \"reading_json\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0544/ocr.json\", \"manifest\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0544/ocr.json\", \"original_evidence_sha256\": null, \"correction_provenance\": null, \"glyph_assets\": [{\"id\": \"g001\", \"description\": \"小篆字形，从木空声（椌）\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0544/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g002\", \"description\": \"小篆字形，从木祝省声（祝/柷）\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0544/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g003\", \"description\": \"小篆字形，从木斩声（槧）\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0544/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g004\", \"description\": \"汉代隶书字形，上斩下木（槧）\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0544/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g005\", \"description\": \"小篆字形，从木乙声（札）\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0544/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g006\", \"description\": \"秦代文字字形（札）\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0544/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g007\", \"description\": \"汉代隶书字形（札）\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0544/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g008\", \"description\": \"汉代隶书字形（札）\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0544/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g009\", \"description\": \"汉代隶书字形（札）\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0544/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g010\", \"description\": \"小篆字形，从木僉声（檢）\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0544/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g011\", \"description\": \"秦代文字字形（檢）\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0544/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g012\", \"description\": \"汉代隶书字形（檢）\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0544/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g013\", \"description\": \"汉代隶书字形（檢）\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0544/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}], \"block_anchors\": [], \"entry_metadata\": \"not_extracted\", \"uncertainties\": [], \"review_queue\": [], \"review\": null, \"spatial_repair_warnings\": [], \"use\": \"provisional_research_lead_inspect_original_page\"}\n836:{\"schema_version\": 2, \"page_id\": \"sha256:610f098b7383499e15005c51bf5908d327b3188e274cc7a1784089e9af80a721:000836\", \"book_id\": \"sha256:610f098b7383499e15005c51bf5908d327b3188e274cc7a1784089e9af80a721\", \"book\": {\"book_id\": \"sha256:610f098b7383499e15005c51bf5908d327b3188e274cc7a1784089e9af80a721\", \"pdf_sha256\": \"610f098b7383499e15005c51bf5908d327b3188e274cc7a1784089e9af80a721\", \"source_pdf_paths\": [\"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/字源 - 李学勤 - 天津古籍出版社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\"], \"current_source_filename\": \"字源 - 李学勤 - 天津古籍出版社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\", \"title\": null, \"author\": null, \"editor\": null, \"edition\": null, \"year\": null, \"publisher\": null, \"volume\": null, \"isbn\": null, \"metadata_provenance\": {}, \"total_pdf_pages\": 1435}, \"source_file\": \"字源 - 李学勤 - 天津古籍出版社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\", \"source_pdf\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/字源 - 李学勤 - 天津古籍出版社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\", \"pdf_page_1based\": 836, \"printed_page\": null, \"metadata_provenance\": null, \"source_sha256\": \"727535e862ef15aa1651584ad40629a31c96adb96d8132eab93ff0ed100300d8\", \"evidence_sha256\": \"dfa0eda20064359999af58f32164aa9284a968ec492376672bc2cedb89ead12e\", \"ocr_review_status\": \"unreviewed\", \"review_dimensions\": {\"transcription\": \"unreviewed\", \"layout\": \"not_requested\", \"glyph_identification\": \"page_references_only_no_crops\"}, \"text\": \"瘤 孱 廉 庖 廚 庫 廄\\n\\n“酸咸甘苦之食,各不胜其味也,而善庖者调之,能使之无味。”(孟蓬生)\\n\\n廚 (厨) chú 定纽、侯部;澄纽、虞韵、其诛切。\\n[glyph:g001]¹ 《说文》小篆 [glyph:g002]² 汉 廚 楷书 厨 楷书\\n[glyph:g003]³ 汉 [glyph:g004]⁴ 汉 厨 楷书\\n[glyph:g005]⁵ 战国 [glyph:g006]⁶ 战国\\n[glyph:g007]⁷ 战国 [glyph:g008]⁸ 战国\\n\\n1《说文》192页。2《汉印徵》卷9,8页。3、4《甲金篆》643页。5-8《四版校补》110页。\\n\\n形声字。从广,尌声。汉代字形中,形旁“广”或变作“厂”,“尌”省作“厨”。这种省写中当然也包含着声音的因素,因为豆与厨古音很相近。因为厨房跟肉的关系是很密切的(《孟子·梁惠王上》:“庖有肥肉。”),所以字形5、6、7都从“肉”。字形5、6“[glyph:g005]”字是楚国的“厨”字,从肉,豆声。但这个跟《说文·肉部》训“项”的“[glyph:g005]”字应当看作同形字。古音豆与朱音近,故三晋文字中或写作“[glyph:g007]”,从肉,朱声;或又写作[glyph:g008],从广,朱声。楚国和三晋文字中的“厨”字大约是在秦统一以后就被淘汰了,并没有保持到楷书阶段。《第一批异体字整理表》规定“厨”为正字,“廚”、“厨”二字则被淘汰了。本义为厨房。《孟子·梁惠王上》:“是以君子远庖厨也。”引申为厨师,厨官。《汉书·王嘉传》:“贤母病,长安厨给祠具。”(孟蓬生)\\n\\n庫 (库) kù 溪纽、鱼部;溪纽、暮韵、苦故切。\\n[glyph:g009]² 战国 [glyph:g010]³ 战国\\n[glyph:g011]¹ 战国 [glyph:g012]⁴ 《说文》小篆 [glyph:g013]⁵ 汉 庫 楷书 库 楷书\\n[glyph:g014]⁶ 战国 [glyph:g015]⁷ 战国\\n\\n1《金文编》657页。2、3《古玺》234页。4《说文》192页。5《银雀山》310页。6、7《古字典》532页。\\n\\n会意兼形声字。从“車”在“广”下,表示屋内有车;車(车)兼作声符。古文字中往往正反无别,故战国文字“库”字也可以写作[glyph:g011],又加两饰笔则作[glyph:g009]。古文字中广旁与宀旁往往相混,故战国文字“库”也可以写作[glyph:g010],又省写一笔则作[glyph:g015]。这些异体或异写到楷书阶段都被淘汰了。《简化字总表》规定“庫”的简化字为“库”,属于类推简化。本义为收藏兵车及其他武器的处所。《墨子·七患》:“库无备兵,虽有义不能征无义。”《礼记·曲礼下》:“在库言库。”郑玄注:“库谓车马兵甲之处也。”泛指收藏各种物品的处所。《管子·治国》:“关市之租,府库之征,粟什一。”又指监狱。《韩诗外传》:“夫奚不若子产之治郑,一年而负罚之过省,二年而刑杀之罪亡,三年而库无拘人。”(孟蓬生)\\n\\n廄 (厩) jiù 见纽、幽部;见纽、宥韵、居祐切。\\n[glyph:g016]¹ 西周 [glyph:g017]² 战国 [glyph:g018]³ 战国 [glyph:g019]⁴ 战国 [glyph:g020]⁹ 《说文》古文\\n[glyph:g021]⁵ 西周\\n[glyph:g022]⁶ 秦 [glyph:g023]⁷ 《说文》小篆 [glyph:g024]⁸ 汉\\n廄 楷书\\n廏 楷书 厩 楷书\\n厩 楷书\\n\\n1、2《金文形义通解》2312页。3《金文编》657页。4《包山》149页。5《楚文编》552页。6《睡甲》147页。7、9《说文》192页。8《汉印徵》卷9,9页。\\n\\n形声字。从广,殸(古簋字)声。此字的演变主要表现在以下几个方面:一是西周金文中形旁或从宀作[glyph:g021],或从厂作[glyph:g016]。二是战国文字中声旁殸(从自,从殳)左边或变从食,右边或变从攴,写作[glyph:g017]、[glyph:g018]等形。三是《说文》古文或从殸省,九声(战国古文字中也借“殸”表示“廄”字,而殸或省写作丩,因此九字也有可能是从人形变来的)。四是秦汉隶书中声旁殸仍然有一些细微的变化。五是进入楷书阶段中声旁“殸”又讹变为“既(既)”,从而产生“廄(厩)”、“厩”等异体。《第一批异体字整理表》规定“厩”为正体字,其他几个字则作为异体字被淘汰了。本义为牲口棚。《诗·小雅·鸳鸯》:“乘马在厩,摧之秣之。”《孟子·梁惠王上》:“庖有肥肉,厩有肥马。”金文中,此字借为簋字。即王簋:\\n\\n823\", \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0836/source.png\", \"reading_json\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0836/ocr.json\", \"manifest\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0836/ocr.json\", \"original_evidence_sha256\": null, \"correction_provenance\": null, \"glyph_assets\": [{\"id\": \"g001\", \"description\": \"《说文》小篆廚字，从广尌声\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0836/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g002\", \"description\": \"汉印廚字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0836/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g003\", \"description\": \"汉代厨字，从广豆声或省写\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0836/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g004\", \"description\": \"汉代厨字，从厂豆声\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0836/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g005\", \"description\": \"战国楚文字，从肉豆声\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0836/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g006\", \"description\": \"战国文字，从肉豆声\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0836/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g007\", \"description\": \"战国三晋文字，从肉朱声\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0836/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g008\", \"description\": \"战国文字，从广朱声\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0836/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g009\", \"description\": \"战国文字庫，车外加饰笔\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0836/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g010\", \"description\": \"战国文字庫，从宀从车\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0836/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g011\", \"description\": \"战国文字庫，从广反车\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0836/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g012\", \"description\": \"《说文》小篆庫字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0836/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g013\", \"description\": \"汉代文字庫\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0836/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g014\", \"description\": \"战国文字庫，从广车\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0836/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g015\", \"description\": \"战国文字庫，从宀车省笔\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0836/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g016\", \"description\": \"西周金文廄字，从厂殸声\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0836/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g017\", \"description\": \"战国文字，声旁左从食\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0836/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g018\", \"description\": \"战国文字，从广从殸变体\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0836/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g019\", \"description\": \"战国文字，包山楚简廄字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0836/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g020\", \"description\": \"《说文》古文廄字，从广九声\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0836/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g021\", \"description\": \"西周金文廄字，从宀殸声\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0836/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g022\", \"description\": \"秦简廄字，睡虎地秦简\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0836/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g023\", \"description\": \"《说文》小篆廄字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0836/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g024\", \"description\": \"汉印廄字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0836/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}], \"block_anchors\": [], \"entry_metadata\": \"not_extracted\", \"uncertainties\": [], \"review_queue\": [], \"review\": null, \"spatial_repair_warnings\": [], \"use\": \"provisional_research_lead_inspect_original_page\"}\n943:{\"schema_version\": 2, \"page_id\": \"sha256:610f098b7383499e15005c51bf5908d327b3188e274cc7a1784089e9af80a721:000943\", \"book_id\": \"sha256:610f098b7383499e15005c51bf5908d327b3188e274cc7a1784089e9af80a721\", \"book\": {\"book_id\": \"sha256:610f098b7383499e15005c51bf5908d327b3188e274cc7a1784089e9af80a721\", \"pdf_sha256\": \"610f098b7383499e15005c51bf5908d327b3188e274cc7a1784089e9af80a721\", \"source_pdf_paths\": [\"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/字源 - 李学勤 - 天津古籍出版社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\"], \"current_source_filename\": \"字源 - 李学勤 - 天津古籍出版社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\", \"title\": null, \"author\": null, \"editor\": null, \"edition\": null, \"year\": null, \"publisher\": null, \"volume\": null, \"isbn\": null, \"metadata_provenance\": {}, \"total_pdf_pages\": 1435}, \"source_file\": \"字源 - 李学勤 - 天津古籍出版社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\", \"source_pdf\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/字源 - 李学勤 - 天津古籍出版社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\", \"pdf_page_1based\": 943, \"printed_page\": null, \"metadata_provenance\": null, \"source_sha256\": \"53e7b2a283bf1177c639a794e0bf3ffae80783f6e597c2036ef142ed4ffdf640\", \"evidence_sha256\": \"e0e29a1eb1b2b5cd6c7a92d292e15f3da3a6f224ba70c3cc798ce92aa4a1e5db\", \"ocr_review_status\": \"unreviewed\", \"review_dimensions\": {\"transcription\": \"unreviewed\", \"layout\": \"not_requested\", \"glyph_identification\": \"page_references_only_no_crops\"}, \"text\": \"心部\\n\\n[glyph:g001]1 西周 [glyph:g002]2 西周 [glyph:g003]3 秦 [glyph:g004]4 秦 [glyph:g005]5 《说文》小篆 [glyph:g006]6 汉 [glyph:g007]7 汉 憲 楷书 宪 楷书\\n1-4、6、7《甲金篆》731页。5《说文》217页。\\n形声字。从心,从目,害省声。金文上为[glyph:g008](“害”省略“口”),下为横目形;也有下从心形的;小篆由金文演变而来,隶楷文字由小篆演变而来,写作“憲”。现代汉字简化时,“憲”简作“宪”(新造形声字)。本义为敏捷、聪颖,读作xiàn。《说文》:“憲,敏也。”墙盘:“憲圣成王。”又指法令。《书·说命下》:“监(通‘鉴’,借鉴)于先王成宪,其永无愆。”引申指宪法;由法令引申为典范、榜样,又引申为方法;又用作动词,义为效法。又读作xiǎn,为“显”的通假字,如“宪宪”义为兴盛的样子,“宪考”即为“显考”。(郭小武 叶青)\\n\\n忻 xīn 晓组、文部;晓组、殷韵、许斤切。\\n[glyph:g009]1 战国 [glyph:g010]2 《说文》小篆 忻 楷书\\n1《甲金篆》731页。2《说文》217页。\\n形声字。从心,斤声。古玺[glyph:g011]作上“斤”、下“心”;小篆变上下结构为左右结构,作左“心”、右“斤”;楷书由小篆演变而来,写作“忻”。本义为心中有所领悟。《说文》:“忻,闿(kǎi,开)也。从心,斤声。司马法曰:‘善者忻民之善,闭民之恶。’”段玉裁注:“闿者,开也。言闿不言开者,闿与忻音近。如昕读若希之类也。忻谓心之开发,与欠部欣谓笑喜也异义。《广韵》合为一字。今义非古义也。”“忻”与“欣”确属同声符同源字。《史记·周本纪》:“姜原出野,见巨人迹,心忻然说(悦),欲践之。”心之开发为启发,由此引申为明察,又引申为心喜、欢欣、高兴。(郭小武 叶青)\\n\\n恽(恽) yùn 影组、文部;影组、吻韵、於粉切。\\n[glyph:g012]1 《说文》小篆 [glyph:g013]2 汉 [glyph:g014]3 汉 [glyph:g015]4 汉 [glyph:g016] 楷书 [glyph:g017] 楷书\\n1《说文》217页。2、3、4《甲金篆》731页。\\n形声字。从心,軍声。隶楷文字由小篆演变而来,写作“恽”。现代汉字简化时,“車”据历代书法作品简体作“车”,“恽”因此类推简化作“恽”。本义为厚重、敦厚。《说文》:“恽,重厚也。”也指谋划、商议。《玉篇·心部》:“恽,谋也,议也。”又用作姓氏,清代有恽敬,现代有恽代英。(郭小武 叶青)\\n\\n惇 dūn 端组、文部;端组、魂韵、都昆切。\\n[glyph:g018]1 《说文》小篆 [glyph:g019]2 汉 惇 楷书\\n1《说文》217页。2《甲金篆》732页。\\n形声字。从心,亯(音chún或dūn)声。“亯”与“享”异字,但在偏旁中简化成“享”。本义为敦厚、厚道。《说文》:“惇,厚也。”《书·舜典》:“柔远能迩,惇德允元,而难任人,蛮夷率服。”(安抚远方的民众,善待近处的臣民,厚待有德之人,信任善良之人,拒绝邪佞之人。如此,远方的外族都会臣服)孔传:“惇,厚也。”由厚引申为重视、注重、推崇等义,由厚道引申为勤勉、努力。“惇”字同声符系列还有“敦、墩、暾、醇、淳”等字,它们有一个共同的底层涵义,即厚重。也正是由于这种深层次的音义联系,才给人们的语言文字理解带来便利。但同时也往往会给初学者、应用者带来一些文字选择上的困惑、麻烦。比如“纯厚、醇厚、淳厚”,“敦厚、惇厚”,就常使人眼花缭乱,无所适从。(郭小武 叶青)\\n\\n忔(慷) kāng 溪组、阳部;溪组、荡韵、苦朗切。\\n[glyph:g020]1 《说文》小篆 [glyph:g021]2 汉 [glyph:g022] 楷书\\n[glyph:g023]3 汉 [glyph:g024]4 汉 慷 楷书\\n1《说文》217页。2、3、4《甲金篆》732页。\\n形声字。从心,亢声。本义为情绪激昂,后多写作“慷”。《说文》:“忔,慨也。”徐铉曰:“今俗别作慷。”《战国策·燕策三》:“复为忔慨羽声,士皆瞋目,发尽上指冠。”汉扬雄《法言·渊骞》:“未信而分疑,忔辞免置,几矣哉!”“忔辞免置”意为因慷慨陈辞得以免除牢狱之祸。小篆为左“心”、右“亢”,隶楷文字由小篆演变而来,写作“忔”。今字多作从“心”、“康”声的“慷”。(郭小武 叶青)\\n\\n慨 kǎi 溪部、微部;溪组、代韵、苦盖切。\\n\\n928\", \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0943/source.png\", \"reading_json\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0943/ocr.json\", \"manifest\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0943/ocr.json\", \"original_evidence_sha256\": null, \"correction_provenance\": null, \"glyph_assets\": [{\"id\": \"g001\", \"description\": \"西周金文“憲”字，上部从害省，下部从心\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0943/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g002\", \"description\": \"西周金文“憲”字，上部从害省，下部从目\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0943/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g003\", \"description\": \"秦代文字“憲”字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0943/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g004\", \"description\": \"秦代文字“憲”字异体\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0943/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g005\", \"description\": \"《说文》小篆“憲”字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0943/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g006\", \"description\": \"汉代隶书“憲”字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0943/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g007\", \"description\": \"汉代隶书“憲”字变体\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0943/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g008\", \"description\": \"金文中“害”字省略“口”的偏旁形态\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0943/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g009\", \"description\": \"战国古玺文字“忻”字，上下结构，上斤下心\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0943/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g010\", \"description\": \"《说文》小篆“忻”字，左心右斤\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0943/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g011\", \"description\": \"古玺“忻”字形体，上斤下心\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0943/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g012\", \"description\": \"《说文》小篆“恽”字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0943/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g013\", \"description\": \"汉代隶书“恽”字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0943/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g014\", \"description\": \"汉代隶书“恽”字异体一\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0943/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g015\", \"description\": \"汉代隶书“恽”字异体二\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0943/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g016\", \"description\": \"楷书繁体“惲”字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0943/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g017\", \"description\": \"楷书简体“恽”字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0943/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g018\", \"description\": \"《说文》小篆“惇”字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0943/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g019\", \"description\": \"汉代隶书“惇”字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0943/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g020\", \"description\": \"《说文》小篆“忔”字，左心右亢\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0943/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g021\", \"description\": \"汉代隶书“忔”字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0943/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g022\", \"description\": \"楷书“忔”字，左心右亢\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0943/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g023\", \"description\": \"汉代隶书“慷”字异体一\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0943/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g024\", \"description\": \"汉代隶书“慷”字异体二\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0943/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}], \"block_anchors\": [], \"entry_metadata\": \"not_extracted\", \"uncertainties\": [], \"review_queue\": [], \"review\": null, \"spatial_repair_warnings\": [], \"use\": \"provisional_research_lead_inspect_original_page\"}\n968:{\"schema_version\": 2, \"page_id\": \"sha256:610f098b7383499e15005c51bf5908d327b3188e274cc7a1784089e9af80a721:000968\", \"book_id\": \"sha256:610f098b7383499e15005c51bf5908d327b3188e274cc7a1784089e9af80a721\", \"book\": {\"book_id\": \"sha256:610f098b7383499e15005c51bf5908d327b3188e274cc7a1784089e9af80a721\", \"pdf_sha256\": \"610f098b7383499e15005c51bf5908d327b3188e274cc7a1784089e9af80a721\", \"source_pdf_paths\": [\"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/字源 - 李学勤 - 天津古籍出版社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\"], \"current_source_filename\": \"字源 - 李学勤 - 天津古籍出版社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\", \"title\": null, \"author\": null, \"editor\": null, \"edition\": null, \"year\": null, \"publisher\": null, \"volume\": null, \"isbn\": null, \"metadata_provenance\": {}, \"total_pdf_pages\": 1435}, \"source_file\": \"字源 - 李学勤 - 天津古籍出版社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\", \"source_pdf\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/字源 - 李学勤 - 天津古籍出版社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\", \"pdf_page_1based\": 968, \"printed_page\": null, \"metadata_provenance\": null, \"source_sha256\": \"88a2c52d85157d57d1ba94b7714cb5b34f8878c69bfb6b919164fd1844b8afa3\", \"evidence_sha256\": \"545976b8cb151b6e88d083c7d78c2ac1ebb93030ab629d829b485c458790e98b\", \"ocr_review_status\": \"unreviewed\", \"review_dimensions\": {\"transcription\": \"unreviewed\", \"layout\": \"not_requested\", \"glyph_identification\": \"page_references_only_no_crops\"}, \"text\": \"慙 休 傷 惶 恥 忝 慙 怍 憐 忍\\n\\n[glyph:g001]——[glyph:g002]——[glyph:g003]——[glyph:g004]\\n《说文》小篆 汉 汉 楷书\\n\\n[glyph:g005]——耻\\n汉 楷书\\n\\n1《说文》223页。2、3、4《甲金篆》750页。\\n会意兼形声字。从心,从耳,耳亦声,从因耻辱而面红耳赤(“耳”、“心”是典型位置)会意,从耳兼示读音。小篆为左“耳”、右“心”,简帛文字也作上“耳”、下“心”;隶书因形近变从“心”为从“止”,成为从“耳”、“止”声的形声字;楷书形体由小篆演变而来,写作“恥”。现代汉字整理时,“恥”作为“耻”的异体字被淘汰。汉字字形流变中常发生借形兼借其音或义的现象,从“恥”到“耻”就是一例。本义为耻辱。《说文》:“恥,辱也。”《周礼·地官·司救》:“三罚而士加明刑,耻诸嘉石(有纹理的石头,立于外朝门左,周民有罪过者,坐在上面以示羞耻),役诸司空。”《论语·子路》:“行己有耻,使于四方,不辱君命,可谓士矣。”也指耻辱的事情。由耻辱引申为羞愧,又用作使动,意为使之羞愧、侮辱、羞辱。(郭小武 叶青)\\n\\n忝 tiǎn 透组、侵部;透组、忝韵、他玷切。\\n\\n[glyph:g006]——[glyph:g007]——[glyph:g008]——忝\\n《说文》小篆 汉 汉 楷书\\n\\n1《说文》223页。2、3《甲金篆》750页。\\n形声字,从心,天声。本义为辱没。《说文》:“忝,辱也。”《诗·小雅·小宛》:“夙兴夜寐,毋忝尔所生(所由生,即父母)。”毛传:“忝,辱也。”《书·尧典》:“否(通‘鄙’)德忝帝位。”后多用作谦词,表示辱没他人而有愧,如《后汉书·杨赐传》:“臣受恩偏特,忝任师傅,不敢自同凡臣,括囊避咎。”现还有“忝为人师”、“忝列门墙(愧在师门)”的说法。(郭小武 叶青)\\n\\n慙 (惭) cán 从组、谈部;从组、谈韵、昨甘切。\\n\\n[glyph:g009]——[glyph:g010]——[glyph:g011]——[glyph:g012]——[glyph:g013]——惭\\n《说文》小篆 汉 汉 楷书 楷书 楷书\\n\\n1《说文》223页。2《甲金篆》750页。3《隶辨》314页。\\n形声字。从心,斩声。本义为羞愧,唐宋后字也作“惭”。《说文》:“慙,媿(愧)也。”《易·系辞下》:“将叛者其辞慙,中心疑者其辞枝(歧)。”《玉篇·心部》云:“惭”,同“慙”。唐李复言《续玄怪录·李卫公靖》:“公惭怖,不知所对。”隶楷文字由小篆演变而来,写作“慙”。现代汉字整理时,将“慙”作为“惭”的异体字淘汰;又据居延汉简等将“車”简化作“车”,“慚”简化作“惭”。(郭小武 叶青)\\n\\n怍 zuò 从组、铎部;从组、铎韵、在各切。\\n\\n[glyph:g014]——怍\\n《说文》小篆 楷书\\n\\n1《说文》223页。\\n形声字。从心,乍声。本义为惭愧、羞惭。《说文》:“怍,惭也。”《论语·宪问》:“其言之不怍,则为之也难。”《庄子·让王》:“审自得者,失之而不惧;行修于内者,无位而不怍。”由羞惭引申为脸色改变。《礼记·曲礼上》:“将即席,容毋怍。”郑玄注:“怍,颜色变也。”(郭小武 叶青)\\n\\n憐 (怜) lián 来组、真部;来组、先韵、落贤切。\\n\\n[glyph:g015]——[glyph:g016]——[glyph:g017]——憐——怜\\n春秋 《说文》小篆 汉 楷书 楷书\\n\\n1、3《甲金篆》750页。2《说文》223页。\\n形声字。从心,粦声。本义为哀怜、怜悯。《说文》:“憐,哀也。”《商君书·兵守》:“壮男壮女过老弱之军,则老使壮悲,弱使强怜,悲怜在心,则使勇民更虑(改变斗志),而怯民不战。”由哀怜、怜悯引申为疼爱、怜爱。石鼓文作上“粦”、下“心”;小篆变成左右结构,为左“心”、右“粦”;隶楷文字由小篆演变而来。现代汉字简化时,“憐”据隋唐墓志、变文简化作“怜”。(郭小武 叶青)\\n\\n忍 rěn 日组、文部;日组、轸韵、而轸切。\\n\\n[glyph:g018]——[glyph:g019]——[glyph:g020]——[glyph:g021]——忍\\n战国 《说文》小篆 汉 汉 楷书\\n\\n1、3、4《甲金篆》750页。2《说文》223页。\\n形声字。从心,刃声。本义为抑制、忍耐,读作 rěn。《说文》:“忍,能(通“耐”)也。”王筠句读:“能读为耐。”《书·汤诰》:“尔万方百姓,罹其凶害,弗忍荼毒,并告无辜于上下神。”《论语·卫灵公》:“小不忍则乱大谋。”战\\n\\n953\", \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0968/source.png\", \"reading_json\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0968/ocr.json\", \"manifest\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-