ical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0997/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g019\", \"description\": \"《说文》小篆“淑”字，从水从叔\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0997/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g020\", \"description\": \"汉代隶书“淑”字形态4\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0997/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}], \"block_anchors\": [], \"entry_metadata\": \"not_extracted\", \"uncertainties\": [], \"review_queue\": [], \"review\": null, \"spatial_repair_warnings\": [], \"use\": \"provisional_research_lead_inspect_original_page\"}\n1096:{\"schema_version\": 2, \"page_id\": \"sha256:610f098b7383499e15005c51bf5908d327b3188e274cc7a1784089e9af80a721:001096\", \"book_id\": \"sha256:610f098b7383499e15005c51bf5908d327b3188e274cc7a1784089e9af80a721\", \"book\": {\"book_id\": \"sha256:610f098b7383499e15005c51bf5908d327b3188e274cc7a1784089e9af80a721\", \"pdf_sha256\": \"610f098b7383499e15005c51bf5908d327b3188e274cc7a1784089e9af80a721\", \"source_pdf_paths\": [\"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/字源 - 李学勤 - 天津古籍出版社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\"], \"current_source_filename\": \"字源 - 李学勤 - 天津古籍出版社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\", \"title\": null, \"author\": null, \"editor\": null, \"edition\": null, \"year\": null, \"publisher\": null, \"volume\": null, \"isbn\": null, \"metadata_provenance\": {}, \"total_pdf_pages\": 1435}, \"source_file\": \"字源 - 李学勤 - 天津古籍出版社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\", \"source_pdf\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/字源 - 李学勤 - 天津古籍出版社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\", \"pdf_page_1based\": 1096, \"printed_page\": null, \"metadata_provenance\": null, \"source_sha256\": \"8aafb7738511df19539d257c513c515ba73b7cb7ed9d11cb238eba10823074f3\", \"evidence_sha256\": \"249252646668385e42f464837edfb7a62d0882128ff6224fd324f96195f004bb\", \"ocr_review_status\": \"unreviewed\", \"review_dimensions\": {\"transcription\": \"unreviewed\", \"layout\": \"not_requested\", \"glyph_identification\": \"page_references_only_no_crops\"}, \"text\": \"扑 捭 捶 拂 擊 抗 捕 挂 拕 拙\\n\\n形声字。从手,毄声。汉隶中,“擊”字形体不统一,但大都为毄声,“毄”字从殳、軎声。但在“擊”字中,“毄”讹变为“豛”,从殳,車声,简化后作击。本义是敲打。《书·舜典》:“予击石拊石,百兽率舞。”《诗·邺风·击鼓》:“击鼓其镗(táng,击鼓的声音)。”引申为攻打,攻击。敲打是一物碰一物,所以又引申为碰撞,由此引申为触及、接触。(方东杰)\\n\\n抗 kàng 溪纽、阳部;溪纽、宕韵、苦浪切。\\n匣纽、阳部;匣纽、唐韵、胡郎切。\\n\\n[glyph:g001]¹ 战国 [glyph:g002]² 《说文》小篆 [glyph:g003]⁴ 汉 [glyph:g004] 楷书\\n[glyph:g005]³ 《说文》或体 杭 楷书\\n\\n1《汗简》29页。2、3《说文》257页。4《篆隶表》875页。\\n\\n形声字。从手,亢声。或从“木”,表示用来抵抗的工具。基本义是抵抗、抗拒。《仪礼·既夕礼》:“抗木横三缩二。”《墨子·非攻》:“(智伯)欲以抗诸侯。”引申为不顺从,违抗。又引申为不妥协,刚正不屈。又表示匹敌、对等。《史记·刺客列传》:“举坐客皆惊,下与抗礼,以为上客。”“抗”在古书中又是“亢”的通假字,表示高亢。《北史·李义深传》:“幼廉抗声曰:李幼廉结发从宦,誓不曲意求人。”“抗”有的从手,小篆中有或体从木。“抗”和“杭”本是一字异体,后来两者发生分化,“杭州”的“杭”用“杭”,“抵抗”的“抗”用“抗”,意义有别了。(方东杰)\\n\\n捕 bǔ 并纽、鱼部;并纽、暮韵、薄故切。\\n\\n[glyph:g006]¹ 战国\\n[glyph:g007]² 战国\\n[glyph:g008]³ 《说文》小篆\\n[glyph:g009]⁴ 汉\\n[glyph:g010]⁵ 汉\\n[glyph:g011]⁶ 汉\\n[glyph:g012]⁷ 汉\\n[glyph:g013]⁸ 汉\\n捕 楷书\\n\\n1、2《战文编》796页。3《说文》257页。4-7《篆隶表》875页。8《隶辨》523页。\\n\\n形声字。从手,甫声。本义是捉拿。《庄子·秋水》:“骐骥骅骝,一日而驰千里,捕鼠不如狸牲。”宋苏轼《答谢民师书》:“求物之妙,如系风捕影。”引申为追寻。旧时衙门担任缉捕的差役称为“捕”,因其工作就是捉拿犯人。清吴肃公《明语林·方正》:“一妪讼巫杀其子,昺遣捕缚至杖之。”“捕”字在汉简中的字形与后代隶书、楷书有区别,是一种较为特殊的过渡字体。(方东杰)\\n\\n挂 guà 见纽、支部;见纽、卦韵、古卖切。\\n\\n[glyph:g014]¹ 《说文》小篆 挂 楷书\\n\\n1《说文》257页。\\n\\n形声字。从手,圭声。本义是区别,区分。《说文》:“挂,画也。”段玉裁注:“古本作画者,此等皆有分别画出之意。”《淮南子·汜论》:“伯余之初作衣也,续麻索缕,手经指挂,其成犹网罗。”引申为涂画,涂抹。但“挂”的常用义是悬挂。《仪礼·少牢馈食礼》:“实于左袂,挂于季指。”引申为放置,又引申为勾住,牵挂。“挂”字作为量词是近代产生的,是由悬挂义引申而来的。如“一挂鞭。”(方东杰)\\n\\n拕 tuō 透纽、歌部;透纽、歌韵、托何切。\\n\\n[glyph:g015]¹ 商 [glyph:g016]² 商 [glyph:g017]³ 商 [glyph:g018]⁴ 商 [glyph:g019]⁵ 《说文》小篆 [glyph:g020]⁶ 汉 [glyph:g021]⁷ 汉 [glyph:g022]⁸ 汉 拕 楷书\\n\\n1-4《甲文编》468页。5《说文》257页。6、7、8《篆隶表》875页。\\n\\n形声字。从手,它声。俗体作“拖”。《说文》无“拕”字。“拕”在甲骨文中从丩从它,左右无别,为会意字。《甲骨文字典》:“从丩从它,与《说文》拕字篆文略同。屈翼鹏谓象以手拖蛇之形,即后世之拕字。《殷虚文字甲编考释》可从。”殷墟卜辞中一般用作人名。本义是拉、拽。《广韵·歌韵》:“拕,曳也。俗作拖。”《汉书·严助传》:“拕舟而入水。”宋梅尧臣《八月十五日夜有怀》:“天为水苍玉,月拕潭面冰。”引申为下垂。被牵引的东西往往拖在后面,由此引申为不及做,延长时间。(方东杰)\\n\\n拙 yè 喻纽、月部;以纽、薛韵、羊列切。\\n\\n[glyph:g023]¹ 《说文》小篆 [glyph:g024]² 汉 拙 楷书\\n\\n1《说文》257页。2《篆隶表》875页。\\n\\n形声字。从手,世声。本义是牵引,拉。后作“曳”。《荀子·非相》:“故君子之度己则以绳,接人则用拙。”晋\\n\\n1081\", \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1096/source.png\", \"reading_json\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1096/ocr.json\", \"manifest\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1096/ocr.json\", \"original_evidence_sha256\": null, \"correction_provenance\": null, \"glyph_assets\": [{\"id\": \"g001\", \"description\": \"战国文字“抗”，左手右亢\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1096/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g002\", \"description\": \"小篆“抗”，左手右亢\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1096/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g003\", \"description\": \"汉代隶书“抗”，左手旁右亢\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1096/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g004\", \"description\": \"楷书“抗”\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1096/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g005\", \"description\": \"小篆或体“抗”，左木右亢\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1096/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g006\", \"description\": \"战国文字“捕”字形一，左手右甫\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1096/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g007\", \"description\": \"战国文字“捕”字形二，下有甫形，字形纵长\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1096/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g008\", \"description\": \"小篆“捕”，左手右甫\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1096/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g009\", \"description\": \"汉代隶书“捕”字形一\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1096/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g010\", \"description\": \"汉代隶书“捕”字形二\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1096/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g011\", \"description\": \"汉代隶书“捕”字形三\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1096/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g012\", \"description\": \"汉代隶书“捕”字形四\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1096/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g013\", \"description\": \"汉代隶书“捕”字形五\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/