但制度的變遷往往不只是「逾制」所造成，「不及」亦其一因，中古車中之取代馬車，即與漢末清流士風密切相關。","title":"中央研究院歷史語言研究所集刊","url":"https://www11.ihp.sinica.edu.tw/storage/w2_file/3297JfBQEEM.pdf"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"cdp.sinica.edu.tw","ref_id":"turn0search15","snippet":"圖二、「員」的字形源流演變 ... 圖五是參考《類纂》，圖六是參考《說文》，皆以小篆「員」為字頭，並分別於其下列出甲骨文「員」及籀文「員」。","title":"個人履歷及著作","url":"https://cdp.sinica.edu.tw/service/documents/T960507.pdf"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"www.taiwanmandarin.com","ref_id":"turn0search10","snippet":"Dictionary/Common words/汽車 ... 車chē·ㄔㄜVehicle, car, or any wheeled transport; a machine using rotating wheels or axles; a surname; archaic war chariot; rook in chess. ...","title":"汽車 (qìchē · qiche) — car | Taiwan Mandarin","url":"https://www.taiwanmandarin.com/word/%E6%B1%BD%E8%BB%8A"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"chardb.iis.sinica.edu.tw","ref_id":"turn0search11","snippet":"甲骨文、金文象一個人張開雙腳站立在樹木之上，表示登上的意思，小篆字的上半部漸漸訛變，不見了人形，並增加「舛」部件。","title":"漢字「乘」：字形演變","url":"https://chardb.iis.sinica.edu.tw/evolution.jsp?cid=6728"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"sino-platonic.org","ref_id":"turn0search16","snippet":"Finally, large portions of this paper will be dedicated to trying to reconstruct the actual use of these vehicles, whether it be for military, ritual,","title":"Wheeled Vehicles in the Chinese Bronze Age (c. 2000–741 B.C.)","url":"https://sino-platonic.org/complete/spp099_wheeled_vehicles_china.pdf"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"downloads.freemdict.com","ref_id":"turn0search17","snippet":"(3)四川省鄢都县已改车都县。 ... (6)丽：七笔。 ... 为避免此字与宁的简化字混淆，原读 zhù 的宁作。","title":"简化字总表 - 1956","url":"https://downloads.freemdict.com/100G_Super_Big_Collection/%E4%B8%AD%E5%8D%8E%E6%96%87%E5%8C%96%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7%E4%B9%A6/%E8%AF%AD%E8%A8%80%E6%96%87%E5%AD%97%EF%BC%88%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7%E4%B9%A6%E3%80%81%E8%AF%8D%E5%85%B8%EF%BC%89/%E7%AE%80%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%97%E6%80%BB%E8%A1%A8.pdf"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"zh.wikipedia.org","ref_id":"turn0search18","snippet":"行、草書楷化例：-{当（當）、韦（韋）、书（書）、门（門）、长（長）、乐（樂）、车（車）、兴（興）、头（頭）、实（實）、东（東）、专（專）、过（過）、报（報）、尽（盡）、为（為）、应（應）、佥（僉）、寿（壽）、会（會）、发}-（簡自「-{髮}-」，但「-{發}-」亦簡化為該字）、-{郑（鄭）、尝（嘗）}- ... 类似地，-{坚（堅），劳（勞），览（覽），学（學），弯（彎）}-这五个简化偏旁（上半","title":"简化字的简化方法","url":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E7%AE%80%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%97%E7%9A%84%E7%AE%80%E5%8C%96%E6%96%B9%E6%B3%95"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"www.reddit.com","ref_id":"turn0reddit19","snippet":"And if they're still being used today, especially since I've seen videos about how Chinese characters are logographs and certain characters like tree 木 for","title":"What's the oldest or first character ever to be used by the Chinese civilization!!! I'm really curious about Chinese history and I wanted to learn if they're still being used!","url":"https://www.reddit.com/r/AskChina/comments/1stp0lu/whats_the_oldest_or_first_character_ever_to_be/"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"zh.wikipedia.org","ref_id":"turn0search20","snippet":"但毛泽东看过后却很不满意，提出：“700个简体字还不够简，作简体字要多利用草体，找出简化规律，作出基本形体，有规律地进行简化。 ... * 1955年10月，《汉字简化方案修正草案》经全国文字改革会议讨论通过，会议后中国文字改革委员会根据讨论的结果作了修改，共修改19個簡化字，及取消一個簡化偏旁，修改后的修正草案经国务院汉字简化方案申请委员会审定。 ... * 1956年1月28日国务院全体会议第","title":"汉字简化方案","url":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%B1%89%E5%AD%97%E7%AE%80%E5%8C%96%E6%96%B9%E6%A1%88"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"zh.wikipedia.org","ref_id":"turn0search21","snippet":"車部，為漢字索引中的部首之一，康熙字典214個部首中的第一百五十九個（七劃的則為第十三個）。在傳統漢字中，車部歸於七劃部首；在中文簡化字中，其則歸四劃。 ... ## 字形 ... 商代甲骨文","title":"車部","url":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E8%BB%8A%E9%83%A8"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"en.wikipedia.org","ref_id":"turn0search22","snippet":"Radical 159 or radical cart (車部) meaning \"cart\" or \"car\" is one of the 20 Kangxi radical s (214 radicals in total) composed of 7","title":"Radical 159","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Radical_159"}]}}
