{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_8","type":"web_search","id":"exec-ea262653-0489-4d2c-bb8d-f8779b39f479","query":"site:unicode.org/cgi-bin/GetUnihanData.pl codepoint 8ECA Unihan ...","action":{"type":"search","queries":["site:unicode.org/cgi-bin/GetUnihanData.pl codepoint 8ECA Unihan","车 简化字 来自 草书 Sui dynasty scholarly source 1956 scheme official","車 Shang oracle bone use Heji 11452 six vehicles database"]},"results":[{"type":"text_result","domain":"www.moe.gov.cn","ref_id":"turn2search0","snippet":"第一部分即汉字简化第一表所列简化汉字共230个，已经由大部分报纸杂志试用，应该从1956年2月1日起在全国印刷的和书写的文件上一律通用；除翻印古籍和有其他特殊原因的以外，原来的繁体字应该在印刷物上停止使用。","title":"国务院关于公布汉字简化方案的决议(1956年) - 中华人民共和国教育部政府门户网站","url":"https://www.moe.gov.cn/jyb_xwfb/xw_fbh/moe_2128/moe_2326/moe_1144/tnull_14350.html"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"unicode.org","ref_id":"turn2search1","snippet":"If you do not know the code point of the ideograph, or have no example of the ideograph to copy, the Search the Unihan Database","title":"Unihan Database Lookup","url":"https://unicode.org/charts/unihan.html"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"unicode.org","ref_id":"turn2search2","snippet":"U+4e00 一 http://www.unicode.org/cgi-bin/GetUnihanData.pl?codepoint=4e00&useutf8=true","url":"https://unicode.org/L2/L2009/09175-unihan.html"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"www.unicode.org","ref_id":"turn2search3","snippet":"http://www.unicode.org/cgi-bin/GetUnihanData.pl? ... http://www.unicode.org/cgi-bin/GetUnihanData.pl?","title":"Multiple encoding used with Unihan database from z-test_at_shiroha.jp on 2012-04-17 (Unicode Mail List Archive)","url":"https://www.unicode.org/mail-arch/unicode-ml/y2012-m04/0049.html"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"www.unicode.org","ref_id":"turn2search12","snippet":"The kRSUnicode field for the character 龜 has the apostrophe doubled, meaning that it does not match the syntax specification (this broke unihan_etl, which relied","title":"L2/24-067 (CJK & Unihan Working Group Recommendations for UTC #179 Meeting)","url":"https://www.unicode.org/L2/L2024/24067-cjk-unihan-wg-utc179.pdf"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"www.unicode.org","ref_id":"turn2search4","snippet":"> This page provides the entire Unihan repertoire of the Unicode Standard in blocks of 256 ideographs.Each block is identified by all but the last","title":"Unihan Database","url":"https://www.unicode.org/charts/unihangridindex.html"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"www.unicode.org","ref_id":"turn2search5","snippet":"Unihan Database Tech Site | Site Map | Search","title":"Unihan Database Search Page","url":"https://www.unicode.org/charts/unihansearch.html"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"www.moe.gov.cn","ref_id":"turn2search6","snippet":"原始汉字主要来自图画，许多字的形体可繁可简。在甲骨文里面，“A”是繁体的车，“B”是简体的车，繁简体同时使用，可见简体字的历史和繁体字的历史一样长久。 ... 1956年1月28日国务院第23次会议通过了《关于公布<汉字简化方案>的决议》。 ... 根据《国家通用语言文字法》，繁体字和异体字属于下列情形的可以保留或使用，就是：⑴文物古迹；⑵姓氏中的异体字；⑶书法、篆刻等艺术作品；⑷题词和招牌的手书","title":"近百年来汉字的简化与规范(苏培成) - 中华人民共和国教育部政府门户网站","url":"https://www.moe.gov.cn/jyb_xwfb/xw_fbh/moe_2069/s7135/s7562/s7569/201308/t20130827_156355.html"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"www.unicode.org","ref_id":"turn2search13","snippet":"UAX #38: Unicode Han Database (Unihan) ... U+9FC3 | Block Name None | Version 5.1 | Count 8 | Code Point Range U+9FC4.. ... https://unicode.org/reports/tr38/tr38-40.html","title":"4/3/26, 1:14 PM","url":"https://www.unicode.org/L2/L2026/26105-uax38-40-update-pri534.pdf"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"www.edu.cn","ref_id":"turn2search7","snippet":"通用规范汉字表》对类推简化问题的处理 1964年5月，中国文字改革委员会根据当年3月文改会、文化部、教育部联合发布的《关于简化字的联合通知》而编印出版了《简化字总表》，在《〈简化字总表〉说明》中有这样的表述：“本表收录1956年国务院公布的《汉字简化方案》中的全部简化字。 ... 具体是： ①“琴、瑟、琵、琶”的上左和“徵”的中下部件“王”最后一笔横变提 ②“魅”的右部件和“籴、汆、褰、衾”的下部","title":"教育部：《通用规范汉字表》问题解答-中国教育","url":"https://www.edu.cn/hzb_8413/20090820/t20090820_400832_3.shtml"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"www.unicode.org","ref_id":"turn2search8","snippet":"Unihan database from that page for any random codepoint(http://www.unicode.org/cgi-bin/GetUnihanData.pl?","title":"Unicode Mail List Archive: RE: Character display problem example","url":"https://www.unicode.org/mail-arch/unicode-ml/y2002-m01/0006.html"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"unicode.org","ref_id":"turn2search9","snippet":"http://www.unicode.org/cgi-bin/GetUnihanData.pl?codepoint=5909 ... I reviewed TR38: http://www.unicode.org/reports/tr38/#N10211","title":"Unicode Mail List Archive: Unihan: kTraditionalVariant vs. kZVariant","url":"https://unicode.org/mail-arch/unicode-ml/y2009-m12/0010.html"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"skxb.jsu.edu.cn","ref_id":"turn2search14","snippet":"1956 年1 月, 国务院全体会议第缺乏群众基础的字不能马上推行; ( 2) 草书楷化的简体字能 ... 第一次汉字简化从1950","title":"第27 卷第6 期\u0001 \u0001 \u0001 \u0001 \u0001 \u0001 \u0001 \u0001 \u0001 \u0001 \u0001 \u0001 \u0001 \u0001 吉首大学学报( 社会科学版) \u0001 \u0001 \u0001 \u0001 \u0001 \u0001","url":"https://skxb.jsu.edu.cn/CN/article/downloadArticleFile.do?attachType=PDF&id=1281"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"unicode.org","ref_id":"turn2search10","snippet":"† Note: 12 code points in the CJK Compatibility Ideographs block (U+FA0E, U+FA0F, U+FA11, U+FA13, U+FA14, U+FA1F, U+FA21, U+FA23, U+FA24, and U+FA27 through U+FA29) lack","title":"UAX #38: Unicode Han Database (Unihan)","url":"https://unicode.org/reports/tr38/"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"www.unicode.org","ref_id":"turn2search11","snippet":"# Unicode® 18.0 Character Code Charts ... European Scripts Armenian Armenian Ligatures Caucasian Albanian Cypriot Syllabary Cypro-Minoan Cyrillic Cyrillic Supplement Cyrillic Extended-A Cyrillic Exten","title":"Unicode 18.0 Character Code Charts","url":"https://www.unicode.org/Public/UCD/latest/charts/index.html"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"www.unicode.org","ref_id":"turn2search15","snippet":"Unihan Core 2020 Radical-Stroke Index ... 躱 8E97 躲 8E98 躳 8E99 躴 8E9A 躵 8E9B 躶 8E9C 躷 8E9D 躸 8E9E 躹 8E9F 躺","title":"Unihan Core 2020 Radical-Stroke Index","url":"https://www.unicode.org/versions/UnihanCore2020RSIndex.pdf"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"en.wikipedia.org","ref_id":"turn2search16","snippet":"S: 汉字简化方案 ... In 1952, the Language Reform Research Committee of China first drafted the List of Frequently Used Simplification of Chinese Characters (常用漢字簡化表草案), affirming","title":"Chinese Character Simplification Scheme","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chinese_Character_Simplification_Scheme"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"rikkyo.repo.nii.ac.jp","ref_id":"turn2search17","snippet":"本文所说的简化字，是狭义的简化字，特指由中华人民共和国国务院公布、于1956年2月1日起在中国大陆分批推行的《汉字简化方案》中的简化字；在对《汉字简化方案》作了一些修正之后，1964年5月出版了总结性的文献《简化字总表》；1986年10月10日《简化字总表》又作了几处修正之后重新发表，成为这一批简化字的最终标准。 ... 因而从时间顺序上说，成书于1716年的《康熙字典》中显然不应该有1956年才","title":"<30382D93A997F98E812E696E6464>","url":"https://rikkyo.repo.nii.ac.jp/record/15458/files/AA11599551_38_10.pdf"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"zh.wikipedia.org","ref_id":"turn2search18","snippet":"但毛泽东看过后却很不满意，提出：“700个简体字还不够简，作简体字要多利用草体，找出简化规律，作出基本形体，有规律地进行简化。 ... * 1955年10月，《汉字简化方案修正草案》经全国文字改革会议讨论通过，会议后中国文字改革委员会根据讨论的结果作了修改，共修改19個簡化字，及取消一個簡化偏旁，修改后的修正草案经国务院汉字简化方案申请委员会审定。 ... * 1956年1月28日国务院全体会议第","title":"汉字简化方案","url":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%B1%89%E5%AD%97%E7%AE%80%E5%8C%96%E6%96%B9%E6%A1%88"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"zh.wikipedia.org","ref_id":"turn2search19","snippet":"文改會委員曹伯韓，在1955年2月撰寫的文章中，解釋印刷字體不用草書偏旁的原因：「為了照顧印刷方面改製銅模的困難，凡是字形結構與手寫簡化字接近的書版用字，不改銅模」，「手寫簡化偏旁和繁體偏旁的差別如果是有規律的，經過短期學習就可以掌握」。 ... 例如：「-{蟲}-」已简化作「-{虫}-」，「-{蛊（蠱）}-」类推简化，但虫部其它汉字不是「-{虫（蟲）}-」的类推简化字；「-{氣}-」已简化作「-","title":"简化字的简化方法","url":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E7%AE%80%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%97%E7%9A%84%E7%AE%80%E5%8C%96%E6%96%B9%E6%B3%95"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"zh.wikipedia.org","ref_id":"turn2search20","snippet":"# 章草（汉魏时代的草书）。 ... - 张书岩、王铁昆、李青梅、安宁，《简化字溯源》，语文出版社，1956年，第18頁、第100-110页 ... * 1955年1月中国文字改革委员会宣布了三个草案：《七九八个汉字简化表草案》、《拟废除的四〇〇个异体字表草案》和《汉字偏旁手写简化表草案》。","title":"汉字简化","url":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%B1%89%E5%AD%97%E7%AE%80%E5%8C%96"}]}}
